                "loc": "LUK.8.4+LUK.8.5+LUK.8.6+LUK.8.7+LUK.8.8+LUK.8.9+LUK.8.10+LUK.8.11+LUK.8.12+LUK.8.13+LUK.8.14+LUK.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 8:4-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.13.1+MAT.13.2+MAT.13.3+MAT.13.4+MAT.13.5+MAT.13.6+MAT.13.7+MAT.13.8+MAT.13.9+MAT.13.10+MAT.13.11+MAT.13.12+MAT.13.13+MAT.13.14+MAT.13.15+MAT.13.16+MAT.13.17+MAT.13.18+MAT.13.19+MAT.13.20+MAT.13.21+MAT.13.22+MAT.13.23+MAT.13.24+MAT.13.25+MAT.13.26+MAT.13.27+MAT.13.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 13:1-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi akagaruka yaatandika kwegyeseza aha rubaju rw'enyanja. Omutwe gw'abantu baingi munonga gwamuteeraniraho, n'ahabw'kyo yaaza omu bwato, yaabushutamamu omu nyana, n'abantu abo boona baashutama aha nkungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabeegyesa bingi omu nfumu omu kwegyesa kwe, yaabagambira naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutegye amatu, muhurire! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubibi akashohora kubiba. Ku yaabaire naabiba, embibo ezimwe zaagwa omu muhanda; enyonyi zaija zaazitorotoora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embibo ezindi zaagwa aha rukiri ahataine itaka ringi; ahonaaho zaamera, ahabw'eitaka kutaba ringi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eizooba ku ryajwire, omushana gwaziteera, zaahonga; kandi ahabw'okutagira mizi, zaayoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embibo ezindi zaagwa omu mahwa; amahwa gaamera, gaazinyuruza, tizaayera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embibo ezindi zaagwa omu itaka rirungi; ku zaaherize kumera, zaakura gye, zaakanya, zaayera, ezimwe zaahitsya makumi ashatu, ezindi makumi mukaaga, n'ezindi igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaagira ati: Oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ku yaabaire ati wenka, abo abaabaire bamwehinguririize hamwe na bari ikumi na babiri baamubuuza aha nfumu egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Imwe muhairwe okumanya emibonano y'obukama bwa Ruhanga, kwonka ab'aheeru bo byona babicwerwa omu nfumu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 6:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ngu okureeba kwo bareebe, kwonka barekye kwetegyereza, kandi okuhurira kwo bahurire, kwonka barekye kushoborokyerwa, ngu batakaahinduka bakasaasirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati: Timurikumanya enfumu egi? Mbwenu shi, muryamanya muta enfumu zoona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubibi abiba ekigambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embibo ez'omu muhanda, ahi ekigambo kyabibirwe, abo nibo baheza kuhurira, ahonaaho Sitaane akaija, akabaihamu ekigambo ekyabibwa omuribo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ezaabibirwe aha rukiri, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakarahuka kukiikiriza n'okushemererwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okushangwa bataine mizi ehamire, beehangaana omwanya mukye; bwanyima hakibaho obusaasi n'okuhiigwa nibaturwa ekyo kigambo, ahonaaho bagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ezo ezaagwire omu mahwa, nibo bahurira ekigambo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 10:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwonka amaganya g'ensi, n'okubeihwabeihwa kw'obutungi bwayo, n'okwetenga ebindi, ku bikijwangamu, byanyuruza ekyo kigambo, kibura kwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ezaabibirwe aha itaka rirungi, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakakiikiriza, bakaana ebyana emirundi makumi ashatu, makumi mukaaga, na igana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
