                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha izooba eryo ku bwabaire omu mwabazyo, yaabagira ati: Nimwije twambukye seeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baaherize kuraga omutwe gw'abantu, baamutwara omu bwato nk'oku yaabaire ari; kandi hakaba hariho n'agandi maato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eihunga ringi ryaija, ebingonzi byateera obwato, amaizi gaabusheeshekamu, bwaba haihi kwijura; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwonka We akaba agwejegyeire, ayeeshegwire omushego enyima omu bwato. Baamusisiimura, baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, torikututaho mutima? Reeba twafa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaasisiimuka, yaakabukira eihunga, yaagambira enyanja ati: Reka, cureera! Eihunga ryacureera; haabaho obucureera bwingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaababuuza ati: N'enki ekirikubatiinisa? Timukagizire kwikiriza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatiina munonga, baagambirana bati: Bantu 'mwe, ogu ni muntu ki, orikuragiira eihunga n'enyanja, bikamuhurira!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
